ative Investment Funds, with operations starting in Q2 FY2027.","quote":"Newly formed company, business to commence in Q2 FY2027. The company has received approval from SEBI to set up Portfolio Management Services and Cat II AIFs","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The company plans to target the NRI market through GIFT city using its life insurance, asset management, and alternative management businesses.","quote":"NRI market through GIFT city through Life Insurance, Asset management and Alternative management companies","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":12.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company's business model aims to maximize customer benefits, gain retail market share, maintain shareholder returns, and focus on increasing the Value of New Business.","quote":"Business construct is to maximize customer benefits while gaining market share in retail space, maintaining shareholder returns and continued focus on increasing Value of New Business (VNB)","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":26.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"outlook","statement":"The company aims to establish a profitable, AI-first platform that offers Indian consumers a wide choice of financial products and seamless omnichannel experiences.","quote":"To become a profitable, AI first platform that connects Indian consumers with the widest choice of BFSI products & manufacturers, delivering seamless omnichannel experiences to become the de-facto financial services marketplace in India.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":44.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"The company's diversified financial services strategy aims to optimize risk and profit to achieve a sustainable long-term return on assets of 4.3% to 4.7% and return on equity of 19% to 21%.","quote":"Diversified financial services strategy seeking to optimize risk and profit, to deliver a sustainable business model and deliver a sustainable ROA of 4.3%-4.7% and ROE of 19%-21% in the long term","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":55.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"India accounts for 16% of the global population but represents only 1% of global healthcare expenditure.","quote":"India has 16% of the global population but only 1% of global healthcare spending","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":37.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The international total addressable market for healthcare products and outsourced services exceeds 204 billion dollars.","quote":"Over $204 bn total addressable market present Internationally for products and outsourced services","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":37.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"Retail mutual fund penetration in India is projected to increase more than fourfold, rising from 4% in 2026 to 15% by 2047.","quote":"India’s retail mutual fund penetration is set to grow over 4x—from 4% in 2026 to 15% by 2047","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":50.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The company maintains a selective focus on retail health due to high abuse risk and on crop insurance due to its current economics.","quote":"selective focus on retail health (given high abuse risk) & crop (given current economics)","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":19.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"The company is reducing its reliance on any single channel to protect itself from regulatory changes that impact the bancassurance channel.","quote":"Reducing dependency on single channel insulating the company from regulatory changes effecting Banca channel.","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":31.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"risks","statement":"Because general insurance is a long-term business centered on size, scale, profitability, and risk, its financial results can fluctuate from year to year.","quote":"General Insurance is a long-term business focused on size, scale, profitability and risk; hence results could vary year on year","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":24.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"As of March 31, 2026, the company's consolidated borrowing mix consisted of 48% money markets, 31% banks, 16% deposits, and 5% external commercial borrowings.","quote":"Consolidated borrowing mix for Money Markets: Banks: Deposits: ECB stood at 48% : 31% : 16% : 5% as of 31 Mar 2026","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":55.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"debt","statement":"The company maintains a diversified borrowing mix across banks, money markets, and the National Housing Bank, focusing on longer-tenor borrowings to support its long-term lending.","quote":"Diversified Borrowings mix between Banks : Money market : NHB with focus on longer tenor borrowings to support longer tenor lending","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":59.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company consistently maintains prudent underwriting and cost efficiency to achieve one of the lowest combined ratios in the industry.","quote":"Consistently maintaining prudent underwriting and cost efficiency to achieve one of the lowest COR in the industry","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"costs","statement":"The company is working on multiple AI use cases across its businesses and functions to increase revenue, optimize operating expenses, and improve productivity.","quote":"Multiple AI use-cases across businesses & functions are being worked upon for Revenue increase, Opex optimization and productivity increase","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":44.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"margins","statement":"The platform allows other manufacturers to sell, operating as a low-inventory and high-margin business.","quote":"Enables other manufacturers to sell on platform. Operates low inventory and high margin business","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":43.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"demand","statement":"The company utilizes data analytics focused on customer segments and demand forecasting to offer best-in-class features to its customers.","quote":"Use of Data Analytics focused on Segments and Demand Forecasting with an aspiration to provide customers “Best in Class” features","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":28.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"tone","statement":"positive","quote":"Significant tailwinds expected from IFRS 17 implementation (effective 01 Apr 2027), primarily driven by discounting of claims and deferment of acquisition expenses","doc_kind":"presentation","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_31072026180854_BFSInvestorPresentation.pdf","page":18.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Consolidated total income and consolidated profit after tax grew by 19% and 18% respectively.","quote":"The consolidated total income for Bajaj Finserv grew at 19% to INR 42,037 crore. And the consolidated profit after tax grew at 18% to INR 6,297 crore.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"improved","statement":"Bajaj Life expanded its new business margin by 4.8% to 15.9% during the quarter.","quote":"The New Business Margin was up at 15.9% for the quarter as against 11.1% for the same quarter last year, an expansion of 4.8%. These outcomes are despite the GST impact of 2.9% on the margins.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Profit after tax for Bajaj Life declined to INR 51 crore due to lower capital gains and GST impact.","quote":"The profit after tax, as was the case with Bajaj General, also de-grew for Bajaj Life to about t INR 51 crore, down from INR 171 crore for the same period last year, again, attributable to lower capital gains","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":5.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"deteriorated","statement":"Bajaj General's combined ratio remained elevated at 104.7% due to fire segment degrowth and higher government health loss ratios.","quote":"The combined ratio for the quarter was elevated at about 104.7%. However, if you look at the number on old accounting basis, it's at about 103.9%. The same period last year, the combined ratio on new basis was 103.6%","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Bajaj Finance management expects its opex to net total income ratio to improve by 25 to 40 basis points in the current fiscal year.","quote":"However, with visibility of green shoots in operating efficiencies due to our AI implementation, the company is confident that the opex to NTI ratio will improve by about 25 to 40 bps in the current financial year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":6.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Management anticipates Bajaj Finserv Direct will break even on a quarterly basis in Q3 or Q4 of this financial year.","quote":"Hence, as the outcome of that, we are certain that in Q3 or Q4, on a quarter's results basis this year, we will break even. And on a full year basis, we will break even in the coming year.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"guidance","statement":"Bajaj Finserv Health expects to reach quarterly breakeven in Q3 or Q4 of FY2028 and full-year breakeven the year after.","quote":"And from our Health company perspective, again, I think we had called out that in Q3 or Q4 of next year, which is FY2028, we should break even and full year basis, the year after that.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":11.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"pricing","statement":"Bajaj General reduced motor segment exposure due to intense pricing pressures in the soft market environment.","quote":"excluding the bulky tender-driven crop and government health businesses, the GWP increased by about 10% as against the GDPI growth of the industry of about 12%, a little lower than the industry due to tactical reduction in the motor segment on account of elevated pricing pressures.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":4.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"Bajaj Finserv's board approved establishing a reinsurance company to expand insurance capabilities.","quote":"Also happy to confirm that the Board of Bajaj Finserv has earlier during the day approved for setting up a reinsurance company as a natural progression of furthering our insurance capabilities.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"initiatives","statement":"The alternate investments subsidiary commenced PMS operations and plans to launch real estate and AI AIF funds.","quote":"with respect to the alternate investments company, which has been set up during the last year, we have now commenced business operations with the launch of our PMS products and also expect the launch of our real estate and the AI AIF in the coming quarter.","doc_kind":"transcript","url":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/BAJAJFINSV_05082026150009_BFSTranscriptSE.pdf","page":7.0,"kind":"extracted"},{"field":"industry","statement":"The Indian general insurance market is currently operating in a soft pricing cycle across major lines.","quote":"In Indian market because there were no major catastrophe losses earlier, the market is soft right now, which means the pricing is much lower than what the average pricing would be in all lines of businesses, be it crop, be it fire, be it motor, b